      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sutton%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Early Sutton industries included a carriage factory, a shingle mill, and a firkin factory for making butter vessels.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
